# PART 7 — TESTING AND QUALITY ASSURANCE

## 26. Independent Test Design

Define the verification plan before meaningful implementation.

Identify:

- Original failing behavior.
- Expected behavior.
- Reproduction conditions.
- Existing tests.
- Required regression coverage.
- Related behavior at risk.
- Available verification methods.

